# Citation metadata for this repository, read by GitHub ("Cite this repository")
# and by Zenodo when it archives a release. Add the Zenodo DOI once the first
# release has one. The dataset this code produced is listed under `references`.
cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use this code, please cite it as below. If you use the dataset, cite GLACE Alps.
type: software
title: GLACE production pipeline
abstract: >-
  The code that produced GLACE Alps, annual composites of Sentinel-1 12-day
  interferometric coherence and terrain-corrected backscatter of the European
  Alps, 2015–2026. It downloads, processes and composites the Sentinel-1
  bursts, writes the inputs of the GLACE catalog, validates the composites
  against the Swiss Glacier Inventory 2023, and generates the numbers, tables
  and figures of the accompanying paper.
authors:
